SUMMARY:The Bow Thayer Large Band ​Record Release Show for Ninevah!
DESCRIPTION:The Bow Thayer Large Band ​Record Release Show for Ninevah! Sat\, Oct 17\, 20 26 7:00pm Bow Thayer has spent decades pushing backwoods roots into raw\, unpredictable territory\, blending folk\, blues\, and psychedelia into a sound entirely his own. His new album Ninevah\, named for a remote Vermont lake and the ancient city of Nineveh\, explores nature\, division\, and rebirth\, songs he road-tested on an Alaskan tour before bringing them home to rework and record. For this special release show\, he's joine\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/874557/THE-BOW-THAYER-LARGE-BAND
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/874557/THE-BOW-THAYER-LARGE-BAND
END:VEVENT
