DESCRIPTION:Mass Save Clinic - Monday\, October 19th\, 11:00am - 1:00pm. Please call me to schedule an appointment with Julie Barbour-Issa\, Energy Advocate for the Town of Norwood. Julie can answer questions about home energy efficiency\, heating systems and more. Residents who heat with gas may qualify for home insulation at no cost if their household income is below $96\,000 for a household of Confirm registration requirements with the Senior Center.\nSource: https://www.norwoodma.gov/document_center/Senior/Newsletters/20261001N.pdf?t=202609281323560
