SUMMARY:Cookie Decorating Class - Half Day CD01
LOCATION:10/27/2026 12:30 PM - 02:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Chef Beth will teach participants fun ways to decorate cookies for Halloween and Day of the Dead. Participants will take home 6 homemade\, decorated cookies. No refunds provided for this class !\nCost: $30.00 Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30892
