DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261027T171500
SUMMARY:Home Alone Safety
LOCATION:10/27/2026 04:00 PM - 05:15 PM Norwood Civic Center - Lydon Suite
DESCRIPTION:Take the first steps toward independence. Learn how to call 911\, choking prevention and relief\, accident and fire protection\, and basic first aid. We'll watch an instructional video\, discuss how to manage your time when you're home alone for short periods\, and explore various scenarios with a wrap up exercise. Please bring a snack and a drink. Instructed by Juanita Allen.\nCost: $60.00 Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30894
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30894
