DTSTAMP:20261009T144311Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T190000
SUMMARY:No Static Tribute To The Music Of Steely Dan!​
DESCRIPTION:No Static Tribute To The Music Of Steely Dan!​ Fri\, Oct 30\, 20 26 7:00pm This event is sold out! Please join us for a live stream on YouTube & Facebook at 7PM EST. Boston's premier Steely Dan tribute band\, No Static returns in full force with the complete ten-piece orchestra. Their execution of Donald Fagen and Walter Becker's bluesy jazz-rock fusion is flat out brilliant\, tackling some of the most intricate music ever written for the rock and roll stage. Two decades of sold-out shows prove this\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/874569/NO-STATIC
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/874569/NO-STATIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
