UID:2026-11-05-jake-la-botz-band-featuring-troy-mercy-thu-510a399@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261009T144311Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T190000
SUMMARY:Jake La Botz Band Featuring Troy Mercy!
DESCRIPTION:Jake La Botz Band Featuring Troy Mercy! Thu\, Nov 5\, 20 26 7:00pm Jake La Botz plays roots-drenched music born in streets\, bars\, churches\, and tattoo parlors\, a songwriter equal parts blues\, gospel\, and grit. His albums Sunnyside and They’re Coming for Me earned Independent Music Awards\, and he’s shared the stage with a long list of musical icons\, including Ray Charles\, Etta James\, Dr. John\, and more. For this show\, he's joined by his band featuring Troy Mercy\, blues gunslinger extraordinaire. Ge\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875965/JAKE-LA-BOTZ-BAND
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875965/JAKE-LA-BOTZ-BAND
END:VEVENT
