SUMMARY:Dave Limina's Wednesdave Blues III ​
DESCRIPTION:Dave Limina's Wednesdave Blues III ​ Wed\, Nov 11\, 20 26 7:00pm Wednesdave Blues is a new once-a-month blues extravaganza featuring pianist and Hammond organ player Dave Limina. Dave is a Boston music legend\, having spent 25 years alongside Ronnie Earl & the Broadcasters and shared the stage with an impressive list of greats. A mainstay on the New England music circuit and Chairman of the Keyboard Department at Berklee College of Music\, he'll draw from his deep well of accomplished friends for a \nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875973/WEDNESDAVE-BLUES
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875973/WEDNESDAVE-BLUES
