UID:2026-11-14-goodnight-moonshine-featuring-molly-venter-of-c08d38b@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261009T144311Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T190000
SUMMARY:Goodnight Moonshine Featuring Molly Venter of Red Molly!
DESCRIPTION:Goodnight Moonshine Featuring Molly Venter of Red Molly! Sat\, Nov 14\, 20 26 7:00pm Goodnight Moonshine is a musical marriage\, pairing renowned Red Molly singer Molly Venter with prolific producer and guitarist Eben Pariser. The songs are Americana at heart\, shaped by Molly's enviable voice and Eben's wide\, imaginative harmonic sensibility. Ryan Sands and Adam Chilenski round out the lineup on drums and bass\, for this full band show on The Fallout Shelter's intimate stage. Get Tickets\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875975/GOODNIGHT-MOONSHINE
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875975/GOODNIGHT-MOONSHINE
END:VEVENT
