BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-19-seth-walker-the-talented-singer-songwriter-gu-28c9eb1@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261009T144311Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T190000
SUMMARY:Seth Walker The Talented Singer/Songwriter/Guitarist Returns!
DESCRIPTION:Seth Walker The Talented Singer/Songwriter/Guitarist Returns! Thu\, Nov 19\, 20 26 7:00pm Revered voice in modern Americana\, Seth Walker returns to The Fallout Shelter with his Gospel-drenched\, Southern-inflected sound and true blue knack for the guitar. Raised on a North Carolina commune by classically trained musicians\, he swapped cello for blues guitar in his 20s\, taking him to Austin\, New Orleans\, and Nashville before settling in Asheville. He's shared stages with roots legends\, reached No. 2 \nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875985/SETH-WALKER
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875985/SETH-WALKER
END:VEVENT
