SUMMARY:John Németh & The Blue Dreamers Blues Legend Returns to The Fallout Shelter!
DESCRIPTION:John Németh & The Blue Dreamers Blues Legend Returns to The Fallout Shelter! Sat\, Nov 21\, 20 26 7:00pm Grammy-nominated blues powerhouse John Németh and the Blue Dreamers return to The Fallout Shelter for a seventh appearance on the Extended Play Sessions. Their 2022 set here became the album Live From The Fallout Shelter\, which reached Top 5 on the Billboard Blues Chart and made Blues Blast's best-of-2023 list. Németh's dynamic stage presence and super-tight band drive original songs that range\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875987/JOHN-NEMETH-AND-THE-BLUE-DREAMERS
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875987/JOHN-NEMETH-AND-THE-BLUE-DREAMERS
END:VEVENT
