UID:2026-11-25-reckoners-thanksgiving-rhythm-blues-blast-wed-6f84aff@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261009T144311Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261125T190000
SUMMARY:Reckoners Thanksgiving Rhythm & Blues Blast!
DESCRIPTION:Reckoners Thanksgiving Rhythm & Blues Blast! Wed\, Nov 25\, 20 26 7:00pm Reckoners bring together some of Boston's most respected working musicians for a rhythm and blues blast to kick off Thanksgiving weekend at The Fallout Shelter. Singer and guitarist Tim Gearan fronts the group alongside bandleader and guitarist Johnny Trama\, drummer Tom Arey\, bassist Marc Hickox\, and keyboardist Darby Wolf. Rooted in early soul and classic rock\, the group has shared stages with Tedeschi Trucks Band\, The Wallf\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/876713/RECKONERS
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/876713/RECKONERS
END:VEVENT
