SUMMARY:Paint Night
LOCATION:01/04/2027 06:00 PM - 07:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Willett Room
DESCRIPTION:Join Letiana from Let's Paint Club for these fun monthly paint nights. Art supplies provided to create your own masterpiece. Participants will listen to music\, be creative\, and have fun. At the end of each session\, painters will have their own 11"x14" painting to keep. So put down the screens and pick up a brush and Let's Paint! Program takes place on Monday evenings from 6:00pm-7:00pm at the Civic Center for ages 6 years and up. Sign up for one or all - they fill fast!\nCost: $30.00 Res\, $40.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30900
