DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270209T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270209T200000
SUMMARY:Cake Decorating - Advanced Class
LOCATION:02/09/2027 06:00 PM - 08:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Art Room
DESCRIPTION:Chef Beth will take you through each step of decorating a holiday cake. Participants will go home with a beautifully decorated cake\, the tips\, angled spatula\, bags and recipes to continue these techniques at home. The November class will decorate a cake just in time for Thanksgiving and the December class will focus on a holiday themed cake. Advanced Cake Decorating The February class will be a more advanced class focusing on more intricate cake decorations on a Valentine's Day cake.\nCost: $70.00 Res\, $80.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30946
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30946
END:VEVENT
