LOCATION:10/01/2026 - 05/06/2027 07:00 PM - 08:30 PM Norwood Civic Center - Gymnasium
DESCRIPTION:Join the Norwood Recreation for our drop in style volleyball program. Players of all skill levels and ages are welcome to join. Schedule is subject to change\, please call ahead 781-762-0466. Fee $5.00\nCost: $5.00 Res\, $7.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30941
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30941
