SUMMARY:Sunnyside Up AA
LOCATION:Grace Episcopal Church — 150 Chapel St\, Norwood\, MA 02062
DESCRIPTION:Open Alcoholics Anonymous meeting. Weekdays\, 7:00–8:00 AM. Verify current schedule with the linked local host page.\nCost: Free\nSource: https://www.gracenor.org/groups
