SUMMARY:Celebrate National Downs Syndrome Day! Wear mis-matched or silly socks to school.
LOCATION:Norwood Public Schools
DESCRIPTION:Source: https://www.norwood.k12.ma.us/oldham/calendar/9274714/celebrate-national-downs-syndrome-day-wear-mis-matched-or-silly-socks-to-school
